        "@id": "https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-3712-1",
        "name": "USN-3712-1",
        "description": "Patrick Keshishian discovered that libpng incorrectly handled certain PNG files. An attacker could possibly use this to cause a denial of service. This issue only affected Ubuntu 14.04 LTS and Ubuntu 16.04 LTS. (CVE-2016-10087)  Thuan Pham discovered that libpng incorrectly handled certain PNG files. An attacker could possibly use this to cause a denial of service. This issue only affected Ubuntu 17.10 and Ubuntu 18.04 LTS. (CVE-2018-13785)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2016-10087",
          "CVE-2018-13785"
        ]
